## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Conceal Pickoff (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Rapid Boots, Dominance Ice, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against one-rotation magic burst that can delete Franco before Bloody Hunt finishes.; Guardian Helmet over Oracle when Use when your team is winning vision but Franco keeps entering river fights too low to threaten a hook.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when the main threat is a basic-attack marksman who has to hit Franco after the hook lands.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Default ranked Franco setup for fast bush-to-bush rotations, Conceal pickoffs, and repeated Flicker suppression attempts.

### Roam Frontline Encourage (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Athena's Shield, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when enemy control is light and map speed matters more than Fortitude's control reduction.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage instead of one clean magic burst combo.; Oracle over Guardian Helmet when Use when cooldown and stronger regeneration matter more than raw out-of-combat HP recovery.
- Total cost: 11650 gold

Safer five-man setup for games where Franco must hold front vision longer and the team benefits more from Encourage than hidden entry.

### Roam Vengeance Anti-Physical (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the physical threats are backed by chain control that stops Franco before he can suppress.; Athena's Shield over Guardian Helmet when Use when the enemy still has one magic burst threat who can punish Franco's first step into river.; Radiant Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use against sustained magic damage that follows Franco through extended front-to-back fights.
- Total cost: 11430 gold

Anti-physical variant for drafts where Franco cannot rely on Flicker picks and must survive marksman or fighter focus after contesting vision.

